      "artist": "U. S. Fish and Wildlife Service - Northeast Region",
      "description": "The Peaks of Otter area is named for three mountain peaks – Sharp Top, Flat Top, and Harkening Hill – in the Blue Ridge Mountains. The area is also home to its namesake Peaks of Otter salamander. Credit: Meagan Racey/USFWS",
